      "text": "[Home](https://www.timeanddate.com/) [Calendar](https://www.timeanddate.com/calendar/) [Year Info](https://www.timeanddate.com/year/)   2023\n\n# UN International Year 2023\n\nThe United Nations has declared 2023 the International Year of Millets to raise awareness of the crop's climate-resilience and nutritional benefits.\n\n©iStockphoto.com/Imagesines\n\nThe United Nations General Assembly has declared 2023 as the [International Year of Millets](https://www.timeanddate.com/year/2023/millets.html).\n\nMany countries take part in the global and local events to promote the UN years.\n\nUN International Year\n\n01. [2025](https://www.timeanddate.com/year/2025/)\n02. [2024](https://www.timeanddate.com/year/2024/)\n03. 2023\n04. [2022](https://www.timeanddate.com/year/2022/)\n05. [2021](https://www.timeanddate.com/year/2021/)\n06. [2020](https://www.timeanddate.com/year/2020/)\n07. [2019](https://www.timeanddate.com/year/2019/)\n08. [2018](https://www.timeanddate.com/year/2018/)\n09. [2017](https://www.timeanddate.com/year/2017/)\n10. [2016](https://www.timeanddate.com/year/2016/)\n11. [2015](https://www.timeanddate.com/year/2015/)\n12. [2014](https://www.timeanddate.com/year/2014/)\n13. [2013](https://www.timeanddate.com/year/2013/)\n14. [2012](https://www.timeanddate.com/year/2012/)\n15. [2011](https://www.timeanddate.com/year/2011/)\n16. [2010](https://www.timeanddate.com/year/2010/)\n17. [2009](https://www.timeanddate.com/year/2009/)\n18. [2008](https://www.timeanddate.com/year/2008/)\n\n[UN Year Index](https://www.timeanddate.com/year/)",
